  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<div><h5>Check replication process is running on master and slave</h5><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f7d07f84-40a1-4f44-9a69-e5da60e61133\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Command</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[show processlist;]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h5>If replication process is running, check if slave is lagging behind master.</h5></div><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9527af25-8aba-476b-b840-9d1f970ede4f\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Command to start </ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[ start master]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><h5>If replication process is running, check if slave is lagging behind master.</h5><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"ec087cc3-eb5a-4212-9f31-aa8c4d172bc8\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Check the status</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[show master status \\g; show slave status \\g;]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"afaba8a1-68b9-4ca0-a7db-cf52422ddb57\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Looking at output from above commands, you'd know</p><ul><li>if slave is lagging behind master.</li><li>replication is failing because of some issues replicating a sql on slave.</li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><h5>If replication process has stopped due to duplicate entry in the slave.</h5><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f47a8f7a-36a9-478d-82e0-e3a1b635cd67\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Solution</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[STOP SLAVE;\nSET GLOBAL SQL_SLAVE_SKIP_COUNTER=1; /*This is to skip the duplicate record*/\nSTART SLAVE;]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"646fd5f5-923d-4327-822a-84931856b74b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">References</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><a href=\"http://www.redips.net/mysql/replication-slave-relay-log-corrupted/\">http://www.redips.net/mysql/replication-slave-relay-log-corrupted/</a></p><p><a href=\"http://dba.stackexchange.com/questions/53893/mysql-relay-log-corrupted-how-do-i-fix-it-tried-but-failed\">http://dba.stackexchange.com/questions/53893/mysql-relay-log-corrupted-how-do-i-fix-it-tried-but-failed</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.percona.com/blog/2014/10/08/mysql-replication-got-fatal-error-1236-causes-and-cures/\">https://www.percona.com/blog/2014/10/08/mysql-replication-got-fatal-error-1236-causes-and-cures/</a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
